1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,492
A memory trick: outside, inside, in between.

2
00:00:04,492 --> 00:00:09,062
Anything on the outside, or made of nerve, is ectoderm.

3
00:00:09,062 --> 00:00:13,619
Anything lining a tube that opens into the gut is endoderm.

4
00:00:13,619 --> 00:00:18,580
Everything in between, muscle, bone, blood, kidney, is mesoderm.

